  "card": "This pull request removes the `-persistmempoolv1` configuration option, dropping the ability to write legacy non-XORed `mempool.dat` files on node shutdown or during `savemempool`. It removes temporary compatibility code introduced in Bitcoin Core v27 now that v26 and earlier versions are end-of-life. Node operators can still read legacy v1 files when upgrading from older releases. The only affected users are those attempting to downgrade to unsupported versions older than v27.",
